{
  "dom_id": "step-e10625",
  "name": "Example: Identifying One as Neither Prime Nor Composite",
  "problem": "Which of the following numbers are prime?\n\n$$\n13, \\quad 15, \\quad  17, \\quad  1, \\quad  6\n$$",
  "worked_solution": "A prime number is a positive whole number with exactly two distinct whole number factors: itself and $1.$ A composite number is a number that has more than two distinct factors.\n\nThe number $1$ is neither prime nor composite.\n\nWith that in mind, let's examine the numbers in the list.\n\n- $13$ is prime since it has only two factors: $1$ and $13.$\n\n- $15$ is *not* prime as it has factors distinct from itself and $1.$ For example, $3$ is a factor of $15\\mathbin{:}$ \n\n$$\n15= 3\\times 5\n$$\n\n- $17$ is prime since it has only two factors: $1$ and $17.$\n\n- $1$ is *not* prime since it has only one factor. Moreover, $1$ is *not* composite either.\n\n- $6$ is *not* prime as it has factors distinct from itself and $1.$ For example, $3$ is a factor of $6\\mathbin{:}$ \n\n$$\n6= 3\\times 2\n$$\n\nTherefore, only $13$ and $17$ are prime.",
  "calculator_instructions": "",
  "fields": [],
  "problem_field_keys": [],
  "answer_fields_complete": null,
  "result": null,
  "proof_feedback": null,
  "html": "<div id=\"step-e10625\" class=\"step\" style=\"display: block;\">\n    \n                 \n                <div class=\"example\">\n                    <div class=\"stepHeader\">\n                        <div class=\"stepName\"><span class=\"stepType\">Example:</span> Identifying One as Neither Prime Nor Composite</div>       \n                        <div class=\"helpButton\" stepid=\"e10625\">?</div>\n                    </div>\n            \n                    <div class=\"exampleQuestion\">\n                        <style type=\"text/css\">\n                            .mjpage .MJX-monospace {\n                            font-family: monospace\n                            }\n\n                            .mjpage .MJX-sans-serif {\n                            font-family: sans-serif\n                            }\n\n                            .mjpage {\n                            display: inline;\n                            font-style: normal;\n                            font-weight: normal;\n                            line-height: normal;\n                            font-size: 100%;\n                            font-size-adjust: none;\n                            text-indent: 0;\n                            text-align: left;\n                            text-transform: none;\n                            letter-spacing: normal;\n                            word-spacing: normal;\n                            word-wrap: normal;\n                            white-space: nowrap;\n                            float: none;\n                            direction: ltr;\n                            max-width: none;\n                            max-height: none;\n                            min-width: 0;\n                            min-height: 0;\n                            border: 0;\n                            padding: 0;\n                            margin: 0\n                            }\n\n                            .mjpage * {\n                            transition: none;\n                            -webkit-transition: none;\n                            -moz-transition: none;\n                            -ms-transition: none;\n                            -o-transition: none\n                            }\n\n                            .mjx-svg-href {\n                            fill: blue;\n                            stroke: blue\n                            }\n\n                            .MathJax_SVG_LineBox {\n                            display: table!important\n                            }\n\n                            .MathJax_SVG_LineBox span {\n                            display: table-cell!important;\n                            width: 10000em!important;\n                            min-width: 0;\n                            max-width: none;\n                            padding: 0;\n                            border: 0;\n                            margin: 0\n                            }\n\n                            .mjpage__block {\n                            text-align: center;\n                            margin: 1em 0em;\n                            position: relative;\n                            display: block!important;\n                            text-indent: 0;\n                            max-width: none;\n                            max-height: none;\n                            min-width: 0;\n                            min-height: 0;\n                            width: 100%\n                            }</style><p>Which of the following numbers are prime?\n<span class=\"mjpage mjpage__block\"><svg xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\" width=\"22.726ex\" height=\"2.509ex\" style=\"vertical-align: -0.671ex;\" viewBox=\"0 -791.3 9784.7 1080.4\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" aria-labelledby=\"MathJax-SVG-1-Title\">\n<title id=\"MathJax-SVG-1-Title\">\n13, \\quad 15, \\quad  17, \\quad  1, \\quad  6\n</title>\n<defs aria-hidden=